    "b-hsw-summary-decision-12": {
      "id": "b-hsw-summary-decision-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Decision",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — Summary surfaces render the dispatch-lease holder, queued handoffs, workflow status, blockers, active operations, recent accepted events, and knowledge-publication freshness together from the snapshot; a free lease renders as an explicit state, and a stale snapshot triggers refresh."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-hsw-summary-why-13": {
      "id": "b-hsw-summary-why-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Why",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — Rejected: inferring a free lease from missing process data, and locally reconciling stale snapshots — both re-derive authority in the client."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
